<title>CANADA: Canadian trade mission to head for Italy.</title>
<headline>Canadian trade mission to head for Italy.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canada's International Trade Minister Art Eggleton said on Tuesday he would lead a trade mission of 20 companies to Italy this week.</p>
<p>The mission, the first to Italy since 1989, will visit Rome, Milan and Parma.</p>
<p>((Reuters Ottawa Bureau 613-235-6745))</p>
